0063:     """
0064:     Pack all foreground fragments into a solid compact rectangle while preserving their colors.
0065: 
0066:     Input structure
0067:     - The background is the dominant color.
0068:     - The foreground is split into monochromatic 4-connected polyomino fragments.
0069:     - The total foreground area is exactly the area of the compact output rectangle.
