0071:     Rule
0072:     - Sort fragments by decreasing area, with equal-area fragments ordered left-to-right in the input.
0073:     - For each fragment, try its identity/reflected/rotated orientations in that order and scan placements from top-left to bottom-right.
0074:     - Keep the first set of non-overlapping placements that fills the whole compact rectangle.
0075: 
0076:     Key insight
0077:     The scattered objects are jigsaw fragments; the output is their canonical top-left packing into the smallest near-square rectangle.
